  _projectName: Tasty Rush
  _thumbnail: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 56db802e3b3fb3f479e4bf2407cdea5f, type: 3}
  _videoDemoLink: https://github.com/AndrejKubik/InteractivePortfolio/releases/download/demo-videos/Tasty.Rush.mp4
  _descriptionText: 'Clicker-Idle game in which you are an owner of a fast food restaurant.


    -
    Attract customers by clicking, hire new employees, buy upgrades for automated
    actions, and merge employees of the same level to upgrade them and unlock new
    recipes.'
  _developmentHighlights:
  - Name: 
    Text: "Customer-Employee system, which creates an easy setup for automated store
      simulation, where customers spawn at the entrance, walk towards the counter
      where employees serve them and they disappear afterwards. \r\n\r\nLater, I
      turned that system into a tool for the asset store."
